# ── IP — factor models, weights, backtests (LOCAL ONLY, never commit) ────────
# Factor IP lives in MFC/IP/ (subfolder); runner/ holds local-only operator
# tools. git refuses to track anything under either path so the IP can never
# accidentally end up on the public GitHub repo. The bare shared/ and
# strategies/ entries are a belt-and-suspenders guard in case files ever get
# moved back to the root.
IP/
runner/
shared/
strategies/

# ── V29.7 — screener/ is PUBLISHED, deliberately ─────────────────────────────
# .github/workflows/refresh-stocks.yml runs the daily stock refresh on a GitHub
# runner, and a runner can only execute what is in the repo. This repo had only
# ever contained docs/, so every screener/*.py returned 404 on main and the job
# no-opped at its preflight.
#
# What this exposes, checked rather than assumed: data plumbing only. server.py
# is a Flask app around a Yahoo→SQLite cache — 0 occurrences of "score",
# "integrity", "quality" or "weight" — and the Integrity Score engine has always
# been public at docs/scores/scores-engine.js. The FACTOR MODELS remain in IP/,
# still ignored above. live_perf.py knows the PATH to the model picks but does
# not contain them, and those outputs live under IP/.
#
# What stays out: the fetch cache, the logs, and every SQLite file.
screener/data/
screener/logs/
screener/**/__pycache__/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# ── Local operator scripts (double-click .command tools — never deploy) ──────
# e.g. refresh-stock-data.command (daily data refresh). Local-only, like runner/.
*.command
# V31.2: commands/ also holds cdp.py, the headless-Chrome QA driver. Everything in
# commands/ is local-only by convention and the backup verifier is built on that
# invariant, but *.command alone would NOT have caught a .py — it would have been
# tracked and pushed to the public repo. Kept local like its neighbours.
commands/*.py

# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env

# ── Local tooling & business docs (never publish to the public repo) ──────────
.claude/
*.pptx

# ── Python cache ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# ── macOS system files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
Thumbs.db

# ── Jupyter ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb

# ── Generated outputs (re-runnable; large PNGs and CSVs not needed in git) ───
strategies/*/outputs/*.png
strategies/*/outputs/*.csv

# ── Excel lock files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
~$*.xlsx
~$*.xls

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
venv/
.venv/
env/
.env_dir/

# ── IDE / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
